{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"fraction-calculator UI copy.method.paragraphs.3","detected_language":"ca","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"fraction-calculator.copy.method.paragraphs.3","keys":["fraction-calculator.copy.method.paragraphs.3"],"locale":"ca","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Els nombres barrejats es converteixen a fraccions impropies abans del càlcul. Aquí, ZXQPH0000QXZ ZXQPH0001QXZ/ ZXQPH0002QXZ vol dir - (ZXQPH0003QXZ + ZXQPH0004QXZ/ ZXQPH0005QXZ), que és ZXQPH0006QXZ/ ZXQPH0007QXZ. El signe s' aplica al valor barrejat sencer. Un decimal com ZXQPH0008QXZ es converteix en ZXQPH0009QXZ/ ZXQPH0010QXZ abans de la reducció.","record_id":"8881bcc44a60bebe2eb1d2a5632bb528f4e713b475fe59a4265abcd4b8f1517e","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"41185047487","seconds":2.2312928051250083,"source":"Mixed numbers are converted to improper fractions before calculation. Here, -2 1/3 means -(2 + 1/3), which is -7/3. The sign applies to the whole mixed value. A decimal such as 0.125 becomes 125/1000 before reduction.","source_commit":"0795f2ac94fd96942ab121fbeaaccf7766f584d4","source_hash":"c26f57418ecb2859de1caae12a63513629fc45b724bef2b93abe9b3bef024aec","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Els nombres barrejats es converteixen a fraccions impropies abans del càlcul. Aquí, -2 1/ 3 vol dir - (2 + 1/ 3), que és -7/ 3. El signe s' aplica al valor barrejat sencer. Un decimal com 0.125 es converteix en 125/ 1000 abans de la reducció.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
